{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-alfal-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"alfal-residence-dubuild-real-estate-development-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Alfal Residence is a luxury 32-storey tower presented by Dubuild Real Estate Development in the picturesque JVC neighborhood. The complex offers different types of residences, including elegant studios and cozy apartments with 1-2 bedrooms, some of which are equipped with a private pool. From the windows and balconies offer spectacular views of the surrounding area.In the finishing of facades and interiors of the complex used high-quality materials in light colors, so that the building fits perfectly into the surrounding landscape, and inside each apartment reigns a comfortable atmosphere.Alfal Residence has a well-developed infrastructure. The residents of the complex are presented with a wide variety of amenities, including swimming pool, gym, sauna and sauna.The location of the complex is also one of its features. In the immediate vicinity there are educational and medical institutions, restaurants, cafes and shopping centers. Circle Mall is just 5 minutes away, Palm Jumeirah, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall, Burj Al Arab and JBR beaches are within 20-25 minutes radius. The drive to Dubai International Airport will take approximately 27 minutes.","price":468180,"title":"Alfal Residence","bitrix":{"id":975,"pf_id":"are.3.14378","source":null,"project_id":"District 15","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Alfal Residence","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Dubuild Real Estate Development","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2637/images/2024/07/28/340x252/mwSK3yqVTeS3qj1l0nBex7imAOX1xnWJIPnYdtVy.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2637/images/2024/07/28/464x312/mwSK3yqVTeS3qj1l0nBex7imAOX1xnWJIPnYdtV